Every module must be testable; add unit tests where reasonable.

Use typed Python (mypy-friendly style) and pydantic for schemas.

Implement extensive logging and structured trace events (JSONL).

Never run code outside the workspace; enforce path constraints.

Keep the first milestone minimal-but-working; avoid scope creep (no UI, no web server).

For each change: explain intent briefly, then output the exact patch / code edits.
